    {
      "id": "stats",
      "text": "Cuba is the largest island in the Caribbean, covering about one hundred and ten thousand square kilometres. Its capital, Havana, sits less than one hundred and fifty kilometres from Florida. And after years of emigration, fewer than ten million people live here today.",
