    },
    {
      "id": "travel",
      "text": "And yet Cuba still draws visitors from around the world. Old Havana, Trinidad and the historic centre of Cienfuegos are all UNESCO World Heritage Sites, and the beaches of Varadero are among the most famous in the Caribbean. You just won't find an official Coke at the bar.",
      "scene": {
