          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "northkorea",
      "text": "Country number two is North Korea. Strict sanctions and a US trade ban keep American companies out, so Coca-Cola does not officially do business here. Just across the border, in China and South Korea, it is easy to find. But in Pyongyang, real cans are rare, and sell for high prices on the black market.",
