    {
      "id": "dates",
      "text": "Here is the whole story in five dates. Eighteen eighty-six: born in Atlanta. Nineteen oh-six: Cuba bottles Coke. The early nineteen-sixties: Coke leaves Cuba. Twenty twelve: Myanmar comes back. And twenty twenty-two: business in Russia is suspended.",
