    {
      "id": "three",
      "text": "So here they are, the only three countries where the Coca-Cola Company does not officially sell: Cuba, North Korea and Russia. Almost everywhere else, from Brazil to Japan, a cold Coke is never far away. Three countries, three very different stories.",
